WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:21.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Quand on parle de cet

00:00:13.214 --> 00:00:23.023 size:53% position:73% line:53%
arrondissement,

00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:29.096 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce qui vient en tête, c'est la

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:30.097 size:53% position:73% line:53%
